1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:03,045
Unity of Hearts

2
00:00:03,246 --> 00:00:04,998
What are Wild Cardbots anyway?

3
00:00:04,998 --> 00:00:07,466
They're trying to make us leave town? Who do they think they are?!

4
00:00:07,466 --> 00:00:11,003
I told you. It's impossible to coexist with their kind. 

5
00:00:11,602 --> 00:00:14,878
Everyone, it's dangerous to be here! Please head back to your homes!

6
00:00:14,878 --> 00:00:17,053
Huh? Blaion?

7
00:00:17,053 --> 00:00:18,977
Mr. Inspector, I'll take care of this.

8
00:00:18,977 --> 00:00:20,445
Soleil! What are you planning to do?

9
00:00:20,445 --> 00:00:23,693
Hey, which one is he? A Metal Cardbot? Or a Wild Cardbot?

10
00:00:23,693 --> 00:00:25,028
I'm a Wild Cardbot.

11
00:00:25,028 --> 00:00:28,202
You mean, you're on the same side as those guys up there?!

12
00:00:28,202 --> 00:00:30,454
Why are you forcing us to leave town? Are you trying to-

13
00:00:30,454 --> 00:00:32,935
I told you I'll take care of this!

14
00:00:32,935 --> 00:00:34,527
Phantom Hornet, take me to the rooftop.

15
00:00:34,527 --> 00:00:35,737
Alrighty!

16
00:00:35,737 --> 00:00:37,383
Blaion, Set Up.

17
00:00:38,844 --> 00:00:40,107
It's a red Metal Cardbot...

18
00:00:40,107 --> 00:00:43,472
No! A Wild Cardbot! He's climbing his way to the rooftop!

19
00:00:45,271 --> 00:00:46,454
Blaion!

20
00:00:46,454 --> 00:00:47,723
You again.

21
00:00:47,723 --> 00:00:48,859
What are you doing here?

22
00:00:48,859 --> 00:00:52,380
I've come to serve as a bridge between the humans of this planet and the Wild Cardbots!

23
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:55,418
Don't make me laugh! We took the chieftain of those little fleshlings hostage- 

24
00:00:55,418 --> 00:00:56,787
Wh- where did he go?

25
00:00:56,787 --> 00:00:57,942
ARRRGH!

26
00:01:00,656 --> 00:01:01,774
Hurry and get out of here.

27
00:01:01,774 --> 00:01:02,573
Who are you?

28
00:01:02,573 --> 00:01:04,215
I'll explain later! Go!

29
00:01:04,215 --> 00:01:05,796
You're a disgrace to the Wild Cardbots!

30
00:01:05,796 --> 00:01:06,938
Bzzt!

31
00:01:07,254 --> 00:01:08,751
I evacuated the mayor!

32
00:01:08,751 --> 00:01:09,349
Got it!

33
00:01:09,349 --> 00:01:13,585
Resist all you want. You're nothing but a lion cub against a dragon!

34
00:01:16,914 --> 00:01:20,248
W-what's this? A battle has broken out on the roof of City Hall!!

35
00:01:26,704 --> 00:01:27,555
Blaion!

36
00:01:45,525 --> 00:01:46,777
Throw me, Phantom Hornet!

37
00:01:46,777 --> 00:01:48,063
Bzzzt!!

38
00:01:48,921 --> 00:01:50,911
Repulsor-lift, activate!

39
00:02:00,679 --> 00:02:01,614
I'm coming!

40
00:02:05,090 --> 00:02:09,299
We will never... allow ourselves to become puppets of the Metal Breath!

41
00:02:10,899 --> 00:02:12,704
Soleil...! Hang in there!

42
00:02:12,704 --> 00:02:13,800
Blaion.

43
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:19,448
I never had any right to call you my friend. Neither did I have the right to bind you to the Metal Breath.

44
00:02:19,448 --> 00:02:21,396
I'm nothing but a man-made machine, after all...

45
00:02:21,396 --> 00:02:25,620
I don't care about any of that! I've never thought of you that way!

46
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:27,145
Ground...

47
00:02:27,145 --> 00:02:28,531
I'm sorry...!

48
00:02:28,931 --> 00:02:30,544
FURY!!

49
00:02:40,594 --> 00:02:41,724
Blue Cop! Set Up!

50
00:02:46,348 --> 00:02:48,638
SOLEIL!!!

51
00:02:51,649 --> 00:02:52,875
Are you alright?

52
00:02:52,875 --> 00:02:53,549
Jun?!

53
00:02:53,549 --> 00:02:54,685
Thank goodness!

54
00:03:01,729 --> 00:03:02,580
You two...?

55
00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:04,275
Hm-hm. Are you alright?

56
00:03:04,875 --> 00:03:06,868
It's just one after another...!

57
00:03:06,868 --> 00:03:07,913
So they're finally here.

58
00:03:09,405 --> 00:03:11,366
Why would you do something so reckless?!

59
00:03:11,366 --> 00:03:13,724
Do you really need a reason to save somebody?

60
00:03:13,724 --> 00:03:16,436
But I’m not a "somebody". I’m a doll made by human hands!

61
00:03:16,436 --> 00:03:18,853
My life is worth nothing. You shouldn't be risking your own just to save mine!

62
00:03:18,853 --> 00:03:20,037
Soleil.

63
00:03:20,037 --> 00:03:24,128
It doesn't matter whether you’re a human, an android, or from planet Machina.

64
00:03:24,128 --> 00:03:26,446
What matters is that we’re friends. Right?

65
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,255
Right...!

66
00:03:31,872 --> 00:03:32,718
Huh?

67
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:34,584
This feels just like...!

68
00:03:34,584 --> 00:03:35,674
Wh- what's that?

69
00:03:35,674 --> 00:03:38,346
That light... It's been a while since I last saw it.

70
00:03:40,993 --> 00:03:41,549
Blaion!

71
00:03:41,549 --> 00:03:42,478
Soleil!

72
00:03:46,668 --> 00:03:48,384
What is happening to us?

73
00:03:48,384 --> 00:03:49,490
I'm not sure.

74
00:03:49,490 --> 00:03:51,698
But right now, we have no choice but to put our trust in this power.

75
00:03:51,698 --> 00:03:52,710
Let’s do this, Soleil!

76
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:53,605
Do what? 

77
00:03:53,605 --> 00:03:56,731
Shout out loud. Shout out the words that come to your mind!

78
00:03:57,758 --> 00:03:58,853
Alright!

79
00:03:58,853 --> 00:03:59,560
Blue Cop! (FX-juntransition)

80
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,707
Blaion! (FX-soleiltransition)

81
00:04:03,479 --> 00:04:05,657
SUPERIOR UNITE! (FX-soleiljun)

82
00:04:35,542 --> 00:04:37,701
No! How in the world can this be possible?!

83
00:04:37,701 --> 00:04:40,754
It's because of the power within Deus Machina's treasure.

84
00:04:40,754 --> 00:04:45,701
How incredibly beautiful... This is way beyond anything I could have ever imagined!

85
00:04:45,701 --> 00:04:48,307
It feels just like... witnessing the Sun...!

86
00:04:48,307 --> 00:04:50,624
A Metal Cardbot and a Wild Cardbot...

87
00:04:50,624 --> 00:04:51,807
...merged into one!

88
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:56,913
Grrr! You think anything's changed just because a puppy and a lion cub merged together?!

89
00:05:00,379 --> 00:05:03,870
Could Soleil and Jun’s heartfelt bond be what united us? (FX-blaion)

90
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:05,670
I can't know for sure... (FX-blueCop)

91
00:05:05,670 --> 00:05:10,293
Perhaps it is the will of Deus Machina that the chosen ones will bring forth the day when Metal Cardbots and Wild Cardbots stand together. (FX-blueCop)

92
00:05:10,293 --> 00:05:11,408
Ah! Jun! Jump!

93
00:05:11,408 --> 00:05:12,413
Uh, what?!

94
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,666
Bzzt!

95
00:05:15,055 --> 00:05:17,766
It'd be hard for them to fight with you two sitting on their shoulders. Right?

96
00:05:17,766 --> 00:05:18,677
Soleil!

97
00:05:18,677 --> 00:05:19,615
Jun!

98
00:05:19,615 --> 00:05:21,641
Let's go, Grand Blue Leon!! (FX-soleiljun)

99
00:05:26,173 --> 00:05:27,697
Mr. Mayor! Are you alright? 

100
00:05:27,697 --> 00:05:30,677
Evacuate the civilians, and activate traffic control immediately!

101
00:05:30,677 --> 00:05:32,882
That way, they can fight without holding back...!

102
00:06:05,158 --> 00:06:07,966
Heh heh heh. Impressive!

103
00:06:07,966 --> 00:06:09,327
It's that attack from before!

104
00:06:09,327 --> 00:06:10,925
We'll be okay this time!

105
00:06:10,925 --> 00:06:12,523
Of course we will. Guys!

106
00:06:12,523 --> 00:06:13,198
Roger! (FX-gbl)

107
00:06:13,198 --> 00:06:16,591
Heavy Dragon... Breath!!

108
00:06:17,144 --> 00:06:19,367
Alpha Omega... (FX-soleiljun)

109
00:06:19,367 --> 00:06:21,396
BUSTER!!! (FX-gblanimate)

110
00:06:34,613 --> 00:06:36,151
Br... Brother!!

111
00:06:36,151 --> 00:06:38,588
Hey! Yer the only one left, horn nose!

112
00:06:38,588 --> 00:06:41,165
Would you care to join us now?

113
00:06:41,465 --> 00:06:44,428
Traitors...! You should be ashamed!!

114
00:06:44,428 --> 00:06:47,187
Gaia... Breaker!!!

115
00:06:54,492 --> 00:06:56,802
Argh!! My Terra Crusher!

116
00:06:56,802 --> 00:06:59,071
I understand why you're angry, Solid Horn!

117
00:06:59,071 --> 00:07:02,740
I can't even imagine how you must have felt, having lost your home and your people.

118
00:07:02,740 --> 00:07:05,362
Join forces with us! We'll help you!

119
00:07:05,362 --> 00:07:08,550
Hahahaha! I don't need your sympathy!

120
00:07:08,550 --> 00:07:13,153
Everyone is dead and gone! This place won't be any different... I'll destroy everything until there's nothing left!

121
00:07:15,036 --> 00:07:16,654
Until I'm satisfied!!

122
00:07:16,654 --> 00:07:18,185
He lost his mind to rage! (FX-blaion)

123
00:07:18,185 --> 00:07:19,415
We have to subdue him. (FX-blueCop)

124
00:07:19,415 --> 00:07:20,218
- Right!
- Mhm!

125
00:07:25,533 --> 00:07:27,190
Howling Thunder!! (FX-jun)

126
00:07:28,038 --> 00:07:29,413
Roaring Flame!! (FX-soleil)

127
00:07:30,339 --> 00:07:34,389
HOWL ROAR PUNISHER!!! (FX-gblanimate)

128
00:07:42,870 --> 00:07:45,793
My people... I'll join you soon...!

129
00:07:45,793 --> 00:07:46,994
Argh...!

130
00:07:54,735 --> 00:07:55,307
Jun!

131
00:07:55,307 --> 00:07:57,834
I'm fine. Just seal him, quick!

132
00:07:58,213 --> 00:07:59,192
Okay!

133
00:08:00,146 --> 00:08:02,952
Wild Cardbot! Change Up!

134
00:08:12,355 --> 00:08:14,386
Solid Horn! Sealed!

135
00:08:15,656 --> 00:08:17,930
Aaugh. We did it...

136
00:08:17,930 --> 00:08:20,021
That was quite a spectacular performance.

137
00:08:20,702 --> 00:08:22,574
- Even if the buildings are destroyed, we can rebuild. What matters are the citizens-

138
00:08:22,574 --> 00:08:23,288
- Even if the buildings are destroyed, we can rebuild. What matters are the citizens-
- Kid! You can't be here!

139
00:08:23,288 --> 00:08:24,637
Dad!!

140
00:08:24,637 --> 00:08:25,872
Anna!

141
00:08:25,872 --> 00:08:27,862
I'm so glad you're okay!!

142
00:08:28,795 --> 00:08:30,939
Aww, is it over already?

143
00:08:30,939 --> 00:08:33,884
Nooo, what a shame! Couldn't you have driven a little faster?

144
00:08:33,884 --> 00:08:35,504
Mother, please... 

145
00:08:37,125 --> 00:08:41,370
You've made me even more curious about the limits of my strength...

146
00:08:42,956 --> 00:08:46,057
We put a stop to those outlaws and it's all thanks to you, Soleil!

147
00:08:46,057 --> 00:08:47,959
You're a hero who saved the town!

148
00:08:47,959 --> 00:08:50,004
I didn't really want to be a hero...

149
00:08:50,004 --> 00:08:54,182
Not only that, you sealed THE Solid Horn! That's my daughter!

150
00:08:54,182 --> 00:08:55,307
Mother, I...

151
00:08:55,307 --> 00:09:00,708
Please let me have a look at your Metal Breath later, alright? I'm just dying to find out how Solid Horn was cut into three pieces!

152
00:09:00,708 --> 00:09:01,636
NO!!

153
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:04,740
I'm sorry!

154
00:09:04,740 --> 00:09:07,447
Hey! Soleil...?

155
00:09:07,447 --> 00:09:12,048
The attackers who stormed City Hall were the Wild Cardbots, which are a different type of machine lifeform.

156
00:09:12,049 --> 00:09:17,850
They attempted to rule Mowtown with violence, and we humans cannot fight them with our strengths alone.

157
00:09:17,850 --> 00:09:25,738
However, we have trustworthy allies on our side. They are the Metal Cardbots. They work day and night to keep Mowtown safe.

158
00:09:25,738 --> 00:09:28,881
As long as they are here, our city's peace will be preserved.

159
00:09:33,155 --> 00:09:34,847
Mr. Mayor, what are you doing?

160
00:09:34,847 --> 00:09:38,938
Metal Cardbots aren't supposed to be Earth's mightiest heroes!

161
00:09:38,938 --> 00:09:41,466
They lost their home and are looking for a place to live. That's all.

162
00:09:41,466 --> 00:09:44,709
I don't like that guy labeling us Wild Cardbots as villains, either!

163
00:09:44,709 --> 00:09:46,277
I have to agree with you on that.

164
00:09:46,277 --> 00:09:47,586
So we actually saw eye to eye for once.

165
00:09:47,586 --> 00:09:50,678
While there are those like us who vow obedience to the master of the Metal Breath...

166
00:09:50,678 --> 00:09:53,072
there are also those who are blinded by their hunger for power.

167
00:09:53,072 --> 00:09:55,623
It is shameful to be treated as if we were cut from the same ore as them.

168
00:09:55,623 --> 00:09:56,320
I'm so sorry.

169
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,691
Why are you apologizing?

170
00:09:57,691 --> 00:10:02,948
My dad has been acting strange these days. I don't think he cares about other people's feelings anymore.

171
00:10:02,948 --> 00:10:07,808
The only thing he cares about are his approval ratings. He used to be such a compassionate person...

172
00:10:07,808 --> 00:10:11,193
Anna. This is what happened at the press conference yesterday...

173
00:10:14,163 --> 00:10:16,244
We'll resume photography soon. In the meantime...

174
00:10:16,244 --> 00:10:17,884
Mr. Mayor. Is something wrong?

175
00:10:17,884 --> 00:10:20,613
Blue Cop. When the Wild Cardbots approached me,

176
00:10:20,613 --> 00:10:24,942
I thought I might never make it out alive to see my beloved daughter ever again...

177
00:10:24,942 --> 00:10:26,561
Sir, you need to come back out now.

178
00:10:27,575 --> 00:10:28,863
Let us go, Blue Cop.

179
00:10:28,863 --> 00:10:29,672
Sir!

180
00:10:30,168 --> 00:10:33,780
...But the mayor fought through it and got back on his feet to continue the press conference.

181
00:10:33,780 --> 00:10:36,594
Your father is truly the most respectable man in this town.

182
00:10:36,594 --> 00:10:40,988
Second only to me, of course! Since I’m the one who did the most to protect this town!

183
00:10:40,988 --> 00:10:43,697
Huh? You were? My audio input device mustn't be working very well if that's true.

184
00:10:43,697 --> 00:10:44,796
Hey!

185
00:10:44,796 --> 00:10:46,523
Maybe you have some oil residue stuck in your ear.

186
00:10:46,523 --> 00:10:48,475
Come here, Blue Cop! Lemme clean your ears!

187
00:10:48,475 --> 00:10:50,056
N-No thanks, Jun.

188
00:10:50,624 --> 00:10:52,455
Thanks, guys.

189
00:10:52,754 --> 00:10:55,644
Soleil! It's dinner time.

190
00:10:55,644 --> 00:10:56,514
I don't need it.

191
00:10:56,514 --> 00:10:58,447
Sigh. It must be puberty...

192
00:10:58,447 --> 00:11:00,198
It seems your daughter doesn't like you.

193
00:11:00,198 --> 00:11:03,350
You're her mother, so try treating her a little more kindly.

194
00:11:03,350 --> 00:11:05,918
Why is everyone picking on me today...?!

195
00:11:06,996 --> 00:11:08,206
What troubles you?

196
00:11:08,206 --> 00:11:10,451
It's my mother. Nothing else.

197
00:11:10,451 --> 00:11:14,364
I think the miracle we experienced today happened only because you opened up your heart.

198
00:11:14,364 --> 00:11:19,148
I'm nothing but a doll made by my mother. There's no way I could have a heart.

199
00:11:19,148 --> 00:11:20,965
You apologized to me back then.

200
00:11:20,965 --> 00:11:24,573
You also said that, as an android, you didn’t deserve to call yourself my friend.

201
00:11:24,573 --> 00:11:29,269
But isn’t the pain you’re feeling in your chest right now proof that you do have a heart?

202
00:11:29,682 --> 00:11:31,320
Thank you... Blaion.

203
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,735
What's that? I can’t hear you.

204
00:11:32,735 --> 00:11:34,059
Thank you!

205
00:11:34,059 --> 00:11:34,960
Heh!

206
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,530
You're welcome.


